  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Expenses of WWF Norway office under the programme &quot;Transforming China&apos;s Commodity Markets&quot;. The aim of this programme is to transform China&#x2019;s market towards deforestation and conversion-free supply chains of pulp and paper, and soy and meat. This involves engaging government, financial institutions, companies and consumers, as well as capacity building efforts to create the motivation and capacity for the companies to make commitments and implement actions</narrative>
  </description>
